{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A narrative-focused <strong>psychological horror</strong> game about <strong>possessed computers</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/1e1344e261f1711f432ce75dc64a4bbe.avif?t=1768850983\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras_big/1e1344e261f1711f432ce75dc64a4bbe.avif?t=1768850983 width=800 height=549 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lonely, but never alone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The computer glares at you, humming incessantly. There is no peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/933ddaf86ef1efbeaf2d51ac6e0b9176.poster.avif?t=1768850983\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/933ddaf86ef1efbeaf2d51ac6e0b9176.webm?t=1768850983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/933ddaf86ef1efbeaf2d51ac6e0b9176.mp4?t=1768850983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modern computers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the 2000s! The state of the art, Bindows Millenium computers can\u2019t wait to take you to the new age of productivity!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354290/extras/dc11364adf2f67